+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the repository analyses found under the analysis root. Same as `updateLandscape`, which is kept for existing scripts.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, under its original name.
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
\ No newline at end of file
